# Nestlancer backend — env templates
#
# Prefer Infisical (docs/operations/secrets-infisical.md). For a clone without Infisical access,
# copy the matching example and fill blanks:
#
#   cp .env.development.example .env.development   # local / docker:up (Infisical `dev`)
#   cp .env.e2e.example .env.e2e                   # e2e stack (Infisical `e2e`)
#   cp .env.production.example .env.production     # production (Infisical `prod`)
#   cp .env.test.example .env.test                 # unit/integration tests
#
# Or export from Infisical into the runtime file used by Docker/CD:
#   infisical export --env=dev --format=dotenv > .env.infisical
#   chmod 600 .env.infisical
#
# See docs/reference/environment-variables.md for descriptions.
